"""Canonical Reality Integrity + Reconciliation Service.

Implements production-grade integrity detection and governed reconciliation
over the single canonical company reality.

This service does NOT create another reality. It operates over the EXISTING
canonical primitives to detect and safely resolve integrity violations.

Key principles:
- Reuse existing canonical primitives (governance, provenance, temporal, epistemic, attention, contradiction, verification)
- Single integrity detection surface
- Governed repair proposals (never silent mutations)
- Historical truth preservation
- Epistemic honesty: OBSERVED / DERIVED / UNKNOWN
"""

